WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
The 100 Ω resistor drops into place. The LED lights up.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Two branches are wired on the breadboard.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.800
The multimeter reads 9 V.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.200
A square wave appears in the mission window.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:25.000
In the workshop, the frequency changes from 1 to 2 Hz.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.800
The Christmas tree LEDs blink.
